{
  "id": "03-stepping-stone",
  "name": "Stepping Stone",
  "format_version": 1,
  "seed": 1003,

  // Teaches: a soft body is something you can stand on, not just a weight.
  //
  // The gap is 122 units and a jump covers about 110, so it cannot be
  // crossed. Nudged over the edge the blob settles on the spikes with its
  // top a little above floor level, and one impossible jump becomes two
  // easy ones. The checkpoint is before the gap because this is the first
  // level where a mistake kills.
  //
  // Note the solid box under the spikes. Hazards are triggers, not
  // geometry: the first draft had spikes and nothing else at the bottom of
  // the gap, and the blob fell straight through them and out of the world.

